#: src/mailman/rules/dmarc.py:341
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"You are not allowed to post to this mailing list From: a domain which "
"publishes a DMARC policy of reject or quarantine, and your message has been "
"automatically rejected.  If you think that your messages are being rejected "
"in error, contact the mailing list owner at ${listowner}."
msgstr ""
"Du får inte skicka till den här sändlistan från en domän vars DMARC-policy "
"anger avvisning eller karantän. Ditt meddelande har därför avvisats "
"automatiskt. Om du tror att dina meddelanden avvisas av misstag, kontakta "
"sändlistans ägare på ${listowner}."
